Sandstone
Light gray fine sand; subangular to subrounded;
moderately sorted; submature; 2% clay;
carboate with some volcanic sediments.  Litharenite.

Clayey Sand
Slightly clayey coarse to fine grained sand;
beige; subangular to subrounded; well sorted;
submature.
Clay less than 10%; Sand greater than 90%.
